        "importance": 2,
        "reason": "The shown data has one output row per input assignment, but unverified relationship cardinality can inflate career totals in other inputs."
      }
    ],
    "fewer_reason": "Five supported concerns remain; sequence, tenure bands, promotion-word counting, summary formulas, scoring, and quality precedence are otherwise implemented."
